{"type":"message","id":"bbf5707d","parentId":"f3e6447f","timestamp":"2026-02-18T03:40:32.614Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-02-18 09:10 GMT+5:30] CRITICAL: Gateway crashes/shuts down instead of staying running. Diagnose and fix.\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- `openclaw gateway restart` returns \"ok\" but gateway process dies shortly after\n- WhatsApp shows connected then disappears\n- Manual `openclaw gateway start` required to bring it back\n- This is a stability emergency\n\n**Investigation steps:**\n1. Check gateway logs for crash reason (look for PANIC, fatal error, unhandled exception)\n2. Identify if it's a configuration issue, port conflict, or resource problem\n3. Check if there are stale lock files preventing clean start\n4. Verify model loading doesn't hang (OpenRouter 429 may cause hang)\n\n**Deliverable:**\n- Root cause found and fixed\n- Code/config changes applied\n- Gateway remains running after restart\n- Verification: `openclaw gateway restart` should keep it up\n\n**Focus:** Stability over all else. Use minimal, safe changes. Report findings and solution clearly."}],"timestamp":1771386032611}}
